  "details": "Add events for when a player opens or closes their main menu, radial menu, and chat box.\n\nThis is useful for determining when to block custom input to prevent conflicts with the VRC UI.\n\nExamples include:\n\n* Preventing custom keyboard bindings from being activated while the user has their chat box open.\n\n* Preventing the player’s view from moving when a menu is open if manually polling mouse or joystick input.\n\n* Preventing mouse or trigger input from firing when interacting with the main or radial menus.\n\nThe methods could extend the existing input event API, for example:\n\n`InputMainMenu(bool value, UdonInputEventArgs args);`\n\n`InputRadialMenu(bool value, UdonInputEventArgs args);`\n\n`InputChatBox(bool value, UdonInputEventArgs args);`",
